{{!-- The road so far — /about's variant of partials/journey.hbs
(the homepage keeps the horizontal scroll-snap strip).

Dense ROWS, not stacked cards: year, place, one line. Seven padded
cards on a rail ran the height of two screens for what is a CV, and
a CV is read by scanning the left column. The "your turn" card went
with them — the page already ends on a call to action, and the
timeline is stronger finishing on the real present.

Dates from the resume — keep in step with journey.hbs. --}}
<section class="section outer">
    <div class="inner">
        <div class="section-head" data-animate>
            <div>
                <span class="kicker">{{> "icons/map-icon"}} {{t "The journey"}}</span>
                <h2>{{t "From graduate to Salesforce GTM engineer"}}</h2>
            </div>
            <a class="section-more" href="{{@site.url}}/courses/">{{t "Start your own chapter"}} {{> "icons/arrow-right"}}</a>
        </div>

        <ol class="cv-list" data-animate-stagger>
            <li>
                <time datetime="2013/2017">2013–17</time>
                <strong>{{t "B.E. Computer Science"}}</strong>
                <span>{{t "LNCT Bhopal (RGPV). Graduated with the will to learn anything and not much else."}}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <time datetime="2018-03/2021-08">2018–21</time>
                <strong>Accenture</strong>
                <span>{{t "Salesforce Engineer — CRM Analytics for trade promotion and telecom, Sales Cloud reporting, mentoring juniors on CRMA."}}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <time datetime="2021-08/2022-06">2021–22</time>
                <strong>Cognizant</strong>
                <span>{{t "CRM Analytics Consultant — enterprise dashboards redesigned for performance and UX."}}</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <time datetime="2022-07/2026-04">2022–26</time>
                <strong>Twilio</strong>
                <span>{{t "Salesforce GTM Engineer — CRM Analytics owner for Sales Ops: pipeline, funnel, forecast, CPQ. Where GTM started to make sense."}}</span>
            </li>
            <li class="is-now">
                <time datetime="2026-05">{{t "Now"}}</time>
                <strong>Education First</strong>
                <span>{{t "Salesforce Engineer, Budapest — migrating reporting from Qlik to CRM Analytics, and writing it all down here."}}</span>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>
